WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:04.291 --> 00:00:06.250
- GET THE HELL OUT OF HERE, YOU PIG-TOSSERS!

00:00:12.375 --> 00:00:17.833
♪♪♪

00:00:22.291 --> 00:00:24.416
- What is UP, my baby football dudes?!

00:00:24.583 --> 00:00:27.166
Us sophomores are here for your orientation.

00:00:27.208 --> 00:00:29.708
- Nice try, freshman. I like a mature QB.

00:00:29.958 --> 00:00:30.916
- Aight, here's the deal, bros.

00:00:31.041 --> 00:00:32.958
Over there you got the divas.

00:00:33.208 --> 00:00:34.583
Clipboard-holders.

00:00:34.833 --> 00:00:37.416
Defensive stars who NEED to make up for their team’s offense.

00:00:37.541 --> 00:00:38.708
White receivers.

00:00:39.041 --> 00:00:41.083
- Did you know volcanoes can’t harm healthy men?

00:00:41.083 --> 00:00:42.083
- [Justin Herbert:] Josh Allens.

00:00:42.458 --> 00:00:44.458
Linemen we don’t have the budget to animate.

00:00:44.458 --> 00:00:46.333
Texans. Do NOT sit there.

00:00:46.458 --> 00:00:47.958
Sexually active kickers.

00:00:48.083 --> 00:00:51.708
And King B and the GOATs. These dudes are, like, hot as s--t, bro.

00:00:51.958 --> 00:00:54.458
- I saw you in college. You’re really good at football.

00:00:55.458 --> 00:00:58.041
- So you agree? You think you’re really good at football?

00:00:58.208 --> 00:00:59.958
- AT PRACTICE, WE WEAR RED!

00:01:00.333 --> 00:01:02.333
- Tom Brady is, like, perfection.

00:01:02.583 --> 00:01:05.166
- He’s so cool, we’re breaking the fourth wall to tell you.

00:01:05.458 --> 00:01:08.208
- One time he scored 31 unanswered points in the Super Bowl.

00:01:08.708 --> 00:01:09.416
… It was awesome.

00:01:15.208 --> 00:01:19.416
- I don’t think my fiancee, Shailene Woodley from "Divergent,"
would like this.

00:01:21.541 --> 00:01:23.708
- Oh, yeah, this whole thing is about how being popular makes you insecure.

00:01:23.708 --> 00:01:24.208
[School bell ringing]

00:01:24.208 --> 00:01:27.708
- [Tom Brady:] I found this bulletin-board material. I think the rookies made it.

00:01:29.541 --> 00:01:32.833
- "The Browns are Serious Contenders." This can never get out.

00:01:33.208 --> 00:01:34.041
- Mm, too late.

00:01:35.041 --> 00:01:36.958
- Oh, @$%#, expectations.

00:01:38.083 --> 00:01:41.291
- "Henry is due for a decrease in production"? Oh, they lyin', lyin'.

00:01:41.708 --> 00:01:44.458
- Why is mine a whole chapter? I’ve only played ONE season, everyone.

00:01:45.541 --> 00:01:47.208
- Do they know everything, or just the crab leg stuff?

00:01:47.416 --> 00:01:48.041
- ENOUGH!

00:01:48.458 --> 00:01:51.708
OK, who here has been personally owned by Tom Brady?

00:01:51.875 --> 00:01:53.166
- ME, RECENTLY!

00:01:53.708 --> 00:01:56.333
- ♪♪♪ Yo, I think we should all just alooong. ♪♪♪

00:01:56.708 --> 00:01:57.833
- He doesn't even go here!

00:01:58.083 --> 00:02:00.583
- [Roger Goodell:] STOP HIDING IN OUR STADIUMS, KANYE!

00:02:00.958 --> 00:02:03.583
- Look, everyone. I’m sorry if my greatness infuriates you,

00:02:03.708 --> 00:02:05.291
but I dare you to come at me!

00:02:05.416 --> 00:02:05.833
- Taunting!

00:02:05.958 --> 00:02:07.833
- [Together:] Aw, come on!
- Boooo!

00:02:10.875 --> 00:02:14.208
- Why should only Caesar be allowed to join a new team
and  recruit all his old friends to play with him?

00:02:14.333 --> 00:02:17.958
Brutus is just as cute as Caesar, right? Brutus is a better pure passer than Caesar.

00:02:18.166 --> 00:02:21.458
People totally think Brutus would make a better Jeopardy host than Caesar,

00:02:21.708 --> 00:02:26.083
and when did it become okay for one QB to win every ring,
That’s not what ROME is all about!

00:02:26.208 --> 00:02:27.708
We should totally just STAB CAESAR!

00:02:29.375 --> 00:02:31.541
Yeah so I’m just happy to be back and playing for the Packers.

